sequenceDiagram
    participant Server as Servidor JMAP
    participant WS as Transport (WebSocket)
    participant SyncHost as JMAP Backend (SharedWorker)
    participant SQLite as Local Storage (wa-sqlite)
    participant Pinia as Mail Store (UI Thread)

    Server->>WS: Push Frame (StateChange)
    WS->>SyncHost: _onStateChange()
    SyncHost->>SQLite: Get old Email sync_state
    SQLite-->>SyncHost: state = 'A'
    SyncHost->>Server: Email/changes (sinceState: 'A')
    Server-->>SyncHost: created: [id_1]
    SyncHost->>Server: Email/get (ids: [id_1], properties: metadata)
    Server-->>SyncHost: { id_1: { subject, from, mailboxIds... } }
    SyncHost->>SQLite: upsertMessages(id_1)
    SyncHost->>SQLite: Actualizar vistas de carpeta
    SQLite-->>SyncHost: OK
    SyncHost-->>Pinia: BroadcastChannel (TABLES_TOUCHED)
    Pinia->>SQLite: listMessagesForView(currentFolder)
    SQLite-->>Pinia: Array con nuevo mensaje
    Pinia-->>Pinia: Vue Reactivity actualiza DOM
